; Spark burst — 8 radial particles. Smaller / fewer than dash_impact
; (14) because the parry is a defensive flourish, not a damage event.
; spread 180° with damping pulls sparks to a halt before they fly off.
[node name="CPUParticles2D" type="CPUParticles2D" parent="."]
